    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380">

                <pb facs="0899" n="803" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg803"/>

                <head>No. 351.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 14, 1879</date>.
                        (Received April 29.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 933.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In my No. 929, of the 10th instant, I
                    communicated the resignation of the new minister of finance. His letter of
                    resignation has been published by the Diario Oficial.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have thought it of sufficient interest to send you a translation of the
                    same.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN W. FOSTER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d380-a1.xml" xpointer="d380-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
